  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 2984110,
  "projectUrl": "https://nlog-project.org/",
  "published": "2025-07-18T06:16:58.453Z",
  "releaseNotes": "ChangeLog:\n- ConsoleTarget - Added ForceWriteLine to match NLog v6 Schema (#5858) @snakefoot\n- Layout.FromLiteral to match NLog v6 (#5866) @snakefoot\n- ChainsawTarget with type-alias Log4JXml to match NLog v6 (#5888) @snakefoot\n- AsyncTargetWrapper - LogEventDropped and EventQueueGrow events fixes (#5883) @dance\n- StringBuilderExt - Change Append2DigitsZeroPadded to array-lookup (#5890) @snakefoot\n- XmlLayout - Support MaxRecursionLimit == 0 (#5936) @snakefoot\n- RegisterObjectTransformation so build trimming will keep public properties (#5936) @snakefoot\n\nNLog v5.2 changes how to load extensions: https://nlog-project.org/2023/05/30/nlog-5-2-trim-warnings.html\n\nList of major changes in NLog 5.0: https://nlog-project.org/2022/05/16/nlog-5-0-finally-ready.html\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/NLog/NLog/releases\n\nFor all config options and platform support, check https://nlog-project.org/config/",
